        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exchange prices (day-ahead DE-LU) and forecast: dvhub.online%@. Feed-in at the exchange price, the way DVhub calculates revenue – without market premium. Import: your tariff from DVhub including grid fees, levies and taxes. Forecast without guarantee."
